{"id":10000105,"name":"欧洛伦","enName":"Ororon","title":"深黯的谜烟","element":"雷","region":"纳塔","rarity":4,"weapon":"弓","birthday":"10月14日","constellation":"夜蝠座","description":"来自烟谜主的年轻人，却与万千生灵一起，生活在原野之中。","affiliation":"米克特兰","cv":{"chinese":"梁达伟","japanese":"近藤隆","english":"内森·诺克斯","korean":"徐正益"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000105-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000105-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Ororon.zip","voicePackageEn":"Ororon","quoteCount":67,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"你好，我是来自「烟谜主」的欧洛伦。我不是卖菜的，但是可以送你一些。\n别担心，没什么特别的原因，也没有想从你这里换取什么。我只是好奇每颗种子最终会长成什么样，所以越种越多。希望它们都能在中意它们的胃里安度晚年。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/pfpip16r44omm4xvc1ylrn45qwlceku.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·怪人","desc":"你听谁说的烟谜主里都是怪人？我以为只有我一个。还有谁啊？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/ipsuc9pcsj97bzzqei69hue9cs29g0s.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·目标","desc":"每个人都应该有一种自己最喜欢的动物，或者蔬菜，或者水果。这样才能知道自己想要成为什么样的人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/8tek46xi8glwa0ivlgh1i3hmjw51jiz.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·迷烟","desc":"不是所有的迷烟都能穿过。如果野心太大，就会被烟雾呛到。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c7/d29nquu6ohpeh78p0xteqrnnevrkow1.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"跑起来泥水会溅到衣摆上，飞的话…浸水的披风又太沉了。还是找个地方蹲会儿吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/2s3tx0odf9lf9lf4vlrygn9euo4ml0b.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"闪电很像蛇。不知道有没有人利用它们的颜色和形状占卜…说实话，有点担心这些人的安全。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1f/tlx3xvgpnxeqlw7lenyekyqw9rlx51d.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"…雪下面葬着什么。轻一点，不要惊醒它们。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/lpo5j8n9twrbjvmc4o5bw0qqie29e4x.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"太阳是永燃之火，纳塔人从不惧怕直视烈日。当然，实在受不了可以戴墨镜。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/cd9dbbont25593br5xry8brifwliyhm.mp3"},{"title":"在沙漠的时候…","desc":"这地方…感觉很难种出东西来。要不还是走吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_weather_desert_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4d/tl05d2u4s1oswuwj7c56yr2p11mbrqz.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"抱歉，虽然睁着眼睛，但我还没醒…正事可以晚点说吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b0/hdvwl9ejag0gimn53b8tddjm7lrs2ya.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"胃说时间到了，应该去吃点东西。但我想不出要吃什么…也可能是脑子还没醒。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b6/n58lcqlpgq5mtfa360v1lrua01x1s7w.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"突然想喝肉龙掌气泡咖啡，不加奶。你说太晚了？那…早上好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/g1m701wxclof0j4qndebsaityrozjvb.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"一到这个时候大脑就会活跃起来。我很早就放弃强迫自己睡眠了，所以你先休息吧，我带上夜灯去看看地里的萝卜。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/lsu2q5pi43eqxrfnhx33meuuotz3i6i.mp3"},{"title":"关于欧洛伦自己·交流","desc":"我知道自己说话有时很难懂。你如果有哪里没听明白，请直接提问，我不介意的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/ejye3g2yd96ahe7ectx6144upswvgws.mp3"},{"title":"关于欧洛伦自己·未解之谜","desc":"我不知道自己是从哪来的，但似乎也并不好奇…比起这个，我更想知道自己该往何处去。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/ihnnbyvpd8s0amdc8hpy4r0h4v6qhll.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·道歉","desc":"抱歉…嗯…我是说，真的很抱歉。一上来就骗你，的确不是什么好的开局。原因已经都告诉你了，绝无虚言。如果你不想接受也没关系，那我会尽量不出现在你面前。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/e6u88c9smq77qvj4fao3sa4iwvldidd.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·谢礼","desc":"这是「凌晨四点」的肉龙掌，「比头大」的青蜜莓，「截至上周为止第一甜」的蜜…还有…哦，还有「咔库库免费问诊券」。\n怎么露出疑惑的表情，这些是送给你的，请收下。你帮了我的忙，但看上去并不缺什么，我只好按照自己的喜好准备了礼物。\n咔库库是谁？咔库库是龙。有机会介绍你们认识。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/kungfju9a00v1bnci2qz0olrystr32d.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"听人说打雷有助于作物生长。我试了下在菜地中央驱动「神之眼」，很遗憾，卷心菜和番茄都不太开心，所以就没继续了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_pendant_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/6bf6505sy6n4y416xbxcvw9ljjhwflc.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"一个小窍门：不要做第一个提出建议的人。就像先长出来的果实容易被盯上，第一个出头的人经常输得很惨。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/kvej6zm5kgswb0yg5290cvos6wz5yhq.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"飞鼯其实并不总像它们在高空滑翔时那样目中无人。它们会突然飞过来，扒在你身上不走。这种时候很难不给它们点好处。从某种角度来看，算是一群狡猾的家伙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/6u2vo5b37q27tuqbt3mkyvi7yzdlchp.mp3"},{"title":"关于希诺宁…","desc":"她好像很喜欢待在高处，尤其是树上。我发现倒挂在树枝上会比躺在上面更解压，有机会可以和她交流下心得。欸，不好吗？大家总说要换个角度看世界，像希诺宁这样的发明家，应该很需要吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_xilonen_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/ay16h6twab8g87hs0fnhlj1akj0zdp1.mp3"},{"title":"关于基尼奇…","desc":"那个阿乔很有意思。它年纪很大，却又年纪很小。基尼奇正好相反，他年纪很小，但年纪很大。你…你能明白我的意思对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_kinich_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/gxqyngf7oykmvepkt2cazthwuck6zp7.mp3"},{"title":"关于恰斯卡…","desc":"恰斯卡很厉害，也很出名。只要她一来，人们就都不吵架了，开始和和气气地握手。最讲理的家伙原来叫「武力威慑」，是个不错的名字。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_chasca_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/h7z9qpmvc919ir5nzms96g87ksgwsg6.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊法…","desc":"别看伊法经常教训病号，他和龙们的关系其实很好。闲下来他会在诊所门口弹吉他，让围上来的龙一个一个跟着唱。\n但其实就是呜呜叫啦。我如果碰到了也会加入。我是说加入龙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_ifa_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/gfjy6x3vucjs0okup83y0chx7du6m90.mp3"},{"title":"关于茜特菈莉…","desc":"奶奶其实是个很直白的人，高兴或者不高兴都会直接表现出来，也不太擅长掩饰自己的情感。你看上去像是她的同辈，或者…甚至比她更大？\n抱歉，这样好像不太礼貌，我不多问了。但如果真是这样，就请你多和她聊聊天吧，奶奶大概受够了身边都是晚辈，见到你会很开心的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_citlali_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/ide3byydz4jmll819girou4j2mhsmvf.mp3"},{"title":"关于伊安珊…","desc":"只能说，还好火神大人没有派她来抓我。她是远近闻名的运动教练，虽然我有身高优势，但很可能跑不过她。障眼法？用多了就不管用了啊。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_iansan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/452xozdoa80xf82uc7s2m3nqhhhoqom.mp3"},{"title":"关于玛薇卡…","desc":"我之前并不认识火神大人。\n我的意思是，我当然知道火神是谁，但并不像当面对过话的那种「认识」。在这之前，火神大人对我来说更像一种刻写着力量的图腾，一个象征着掌控全局的标志。这在我心中并不算切实的了解，所以我产生了疑问。\n现在疑问消失了不少，我很开心，也有些心虚和羞愧…她似乎从不迷茫，知道火焰为何长燃，所以无论如何不能让其熄灭。我希望…希望自己能成为帮得上纳塔的人。\n当然，关于她我还有一些思考…上次在宴会上见到她吃了很多很多绿叶蔬菜，我们还聊了这件事，她说她很喜欢营养均衡的感觉。总觉得，是比想象中更细致的人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_mavuika_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e4/9wvhcc1ku758o4krik1r3mcynbufqyh.mp3"},{"title":"关于「队长」…","desc":"真是一段奇异又仓促的缘分。\n都说烟谜主的人擅长预知未来，但我在路边遇到「队长」时，从没想过事情会变得这样复杂。在你看来，人情是可以简单两清的吗？如果是，我心中为何仍保留感激与亏欠？\n…又或许是我考虑得太多了。无论之前发生了什么，他帮助拯救了纳塔岌岌可危的地脉，是一位值得尊敬的英雄。我会一直记得他的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_teammate_capitano_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/fkb9qo4q2nauog6f9a4d637ssg5u2t5.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解欧洛伦·其一","desc":"你好。要握手吗？纳塔人打招呼一般不会这样正式，但你想要也可以。其实在远处喊一声就够了，我听力很好，会察觉到的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/rrfrjk7edhu6va6g4aa2k5x8z46tcrm.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解欧洛伦·其二","desc":"你似乎总是很忙，我也希望像你一样，一直有事可做。但有时，我又很喜欢清闲度日。人的心情真多变啊，我自己也控制不了，真为难。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/ah59ipqhesa6b2t0epe2nnvq0tvjtyq.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解欧洛伦·其三","desc":"纳塔的白天很热，所以除非必要，我更喜欢晚上出门。你见过夜晚的水面吗？月光让水波闪着光，看起来十分清亮。但只有在阳光下你才能看清它是不是真的干净，所以，尽量不要触碰夜晚漆黑的水。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/e311lbauaoj54sm1naboam5hvdrlkk5.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解欧洛伦·其四","desc":"我对灵魂的感知天生比其他人强一些。怎么描述呢…人的灵魂有些像一团团莫测的能量，如果世界上有形态各异的小龙棉花糖，那大概就是灵魂的样子吧。你的灵魂很温暖，是烤过的那种。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/92/qqkzsccq50alfk1n4wdzgkva03w6ptk.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解欧洛伦·其五","desc":"老实说，我自己对自己也不甚了解。我总是有很多疑问；已有的问题还没得到解决，马上又会有新的加入进来。\n好像没有什么特别好的解决办法…只能尽量往前走，对吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/ffb593jl51w7cum78ohtkuxbs2qvrue.mp3"},{"title":"欧洛伦的爱好…","desc":"除了种菜和观察蜜虫以外的爱好？有的。…当然有，给我点时间，会想出来的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ec/t7xfezr8yv85564nmjdbxyl0ibrdo17.mp3"},{"title":"欧洛伦的烦恼…","desc":"有时，想要和做到之间的距离真的很难跨越。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_dialog_annoyed_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/i1i5coimoyr37jbbztdcrjuzaph8xm9.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"吃塔塔可时，在下面放一张空饼皮。只要吃得足够多，掉下来的食材就能变成一个新的塔塔可了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/d4srde82xhu54deft34onnohux7mw5i.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"军用食品…尤其是压缩饼干。它们就像「队长」的灵魂一样沉重…品质很好，只是太硬了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/gqlwu6uj0ykjljrz6yv5xpnikyore6a.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"厉害，比我自己做的好吃。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/pg10o1bfpac0ckr3ep35g4a3y8tk9xg.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"不多不少，正正好的味道。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/llep1np0p49s7h7l3jssxeethsgmdmz.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"我不太明白…这是什么艺术？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/7ig7z34m6f0vz89oz2pkuzle11764v5.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"在纳塔，有种说法是，一个人的出生日期决定了他的命运。如果他的生日和某位大英雄是同一天，那他就会得到这位英雄的庇佑，拥有和他一样的品质。\n我想，和你共享生日的人一定很幸运。生日快乐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4b/o0h4atgyj8rn4o2aplya68oiqk2bpku.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"你刚刚拿给我的是什么？能再让我看一下吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/fxz0s786rdd9j9wx57g0jc12pp3ofz3.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"我是不是应该叫你声老师？谢谢你，{M#爷爷}{F#奶奶}老师，我学到很多。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_starUp_02b","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6e/jwzuk1rawa6isi2mr89hzpl5sb05yem.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"身体很轻，看来可以一下子去到更高的地方了。但要控制好力道，因为磕到头会很疼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/p3svsh5qtkdnfkd2nqsva7dfap5w65o.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我还没能力窥探死亡的界限，但你的帮助似乎将死亡推得更远了一些。放心，我不会因此就去随心所欲做坏事的，我保证。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/ra2ywjg7oyvezsg74a7gyep6ktj9nvw.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"别跑太远。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/79wautg9k0qhqo00q42vkpluzmdz02i.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"再见咯。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/7oo5s01eoc2knscplwpmyae592zpzuk.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"放生！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f5/68z1sg04j58vlihkhmrax3324d30713.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"去吧，你自由了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/kfu9brn6bq40lin7kvqm1qygvdl9kjb.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"来，跟大家问好。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/rc2n4uhomb6s8k3st5qt9r7z4eekw65.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"帮我四处看看。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/74/87t8eb2h5eugrceo7zqxxzr6poqruco.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"你对宝箱的热情正在威胁它们的生存环境。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e7/hafzq19yy0yefz0xjax9m95kh6uy56s.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"敲上去的声音很清脆，应该是颗不错的果实。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/ojggio3ndfv7k6wnb9sknxenhc5mm35.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"小心哦，有些龙喜欢躲在箱子里。可能是内向吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/68/lyyig6cq20vcq4v1w64utqytawpoag5.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"跑不动了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1a/ensjstbh0m818tg0s45vliwzgkaab5r.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"警惕…！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/7ocygn3nnswuqf3jll6oqzvbs2r7b39.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"坏兆头。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/p76bc2c1oizhvpgcyfjy98vpa46uc4l.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"要带你去看医生吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/8vf6655eailowx82tj4rnnw3ye9qu6b.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"我先补上。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/llla4op254x6j4wsmvf526v5a9bmk2r.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"先走一步…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9f/j4qt6e6xzgop77bk3mnqdl2a6afvcrk.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"看不清了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b0/py7tdyijlsgjqn3bw4o5deppd7xfl3t.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"听见了…不该存在的声音…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9a/ipttlnoazra46g8zmlv2y00zo3ui62s.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"呃，跑慢了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/9ch9ljfipypqcoj4dakwasouju1z0pl.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"这不对吧？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_olorun/vo_olorun_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/9c34wqdmh99sef1qey2jjgncg2xt2nk.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"要我加入吗？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_olorun_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1f/9rghnd50478maxf600391h8jjghktbe.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"去哪？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_olorun_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/0e2tikc8mne1evyj8wgelios26o1djz.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"能不能先说，是好事还是坏事？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_olorun_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/9ho492dx6fk3l66t8z3004mvehvchgq.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000105-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000105-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1197,"fullArtHeight":965}